@base = http://localhost:5080
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@sessionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@gameId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### JWT login (Development admin from appsettings.Development.json)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@muzloto.local","password":"Admin2026!"}

### Without token -> 401
GET {{base}}/api/v1/sessions

### Registered User token -> 403 on staff API (register at /account/register first)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"REPLACE_WITH_REGISTERED_USER_EMAIL","password":"REPLACE_WITH_PASSWORD"}

### v1 list
GET {{base}}/api/v1/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v2 list & search (different response structure)
GET {{base}}/api/v2/sessions?page=1&pageSize=20&search=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v2 create (Admin only; first create a game in the Razor admin UI)
POST {{base}}/api/v2/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gameId": "{{gameId}}",
  "startsAt": "2026-11-12T19:00:00+03:00",
  "location": { "name": "Пример площадки", "timeZone": "Europe/Moscow" },
  "seats": { "total": 80 },
  "ticketPrice": 1500,
  "durationMinutes": 120,
  "ageLimit": 12,
  "salesOpen": true
}

### v2 get
GET {{base}}/api/v2/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v1 replace (full v1 contract)
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gameId": "{{gameId}}", "startsAt": "2026-11-12T19:00:00+03:00",
  "timeZoneId": "Europe/Moscow", "venue": "Пример площадки",
  "capacity": 100, "ticketPrice": 1500,
  "durationMinutes": 120, "ageLimit": 12, "salesOpen": true
}

### delete (only sessions without bookings)
DELETE {{base}}/api/v2/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
